{"path":"io/manip/setiosflags","title":"std::setiosflags","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>setiosflags","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/setiosflags","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"When used in an expression out << setiosflags(mask) or in >> setiosflags(mask), sets all format flags of the stream out or in as specified by the mask.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/iomanip\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*unspecified*/</span> setiosflags<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1695\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">fmtflags</span></span></a> mask <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>When used in an expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> setiosflags<span class=\"br0\">(</span>mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> setiosflags<span class=\"br0\">(</span>mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, sets all format flags of the stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in</span></code> as specified by the <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">mask</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> mask\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> bitmask of the flags to set\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An object of unspecified type such that\n</p>\n<ul><li> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code> is an object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, the expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> setiosflags<span class=\"br0\">(</span>mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n<ul><li> has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> has value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out</span></code>\n</li><li> behaves as if it called <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f<span class=\"br0\">(</span>out, mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n</li><li> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in</span></code> is an object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\"><span class=\"kw1730\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_istream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, the expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> setiosflags<span class=\"br0\">(</span>mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n<ul><li> has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\"><span class=\"kw1730\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_istream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> has value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">in</span></code>\n</li><li> behaves as if it called <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f<span class=\"br0\">(</span>in, mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n</li></ul>\n<p>where the function <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">f</span></code> is defined as:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base\"><span class=\"kw1686\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> str, <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1695\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">fmtflags</span></span></a> mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// set specified flags</span>\n    str.<span class=\"me1\">setf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>mask<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/resetiosflags\"><span class=\"kw1809\">std::<span class=\"me2\">resetiosflags</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1696\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">dec</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">setiosflags</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>  <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1698\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">hex</span></span></a>\n                                  <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1713\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">uppercase</span></span></a>\n                                  <span class=\"sy3\">|</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/fmtflags\"><span class=\"kw1708\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ios_base</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">showbase</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0X2A</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue183\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 183</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td><code>setiosflags</code> could only be used with streams<br>of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::ostream</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istream\">std::istream</a></span>\n</td>\n<td>usable with any<br>character stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/setf\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>setf</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets specific format flag <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::ios_base</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/resetiosflags\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>resetiosflags</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  clears the specified ios_base flags <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::setiosflags","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. When used in an expression out << setiosflags(mask) or in >> setiosflags(mask), sets all format flags of the stream…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"mask"},{"label":"Return value","note":"An object of unspecified type such that"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"setf","note":"sets specific format flag"},{"label":"resetiosflags","note":"clears the specified ios_base flags"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":214,"codeBlockCount":3}
